{
  "name": "Commerce Viva Wallet",
  "data_name": "commerce_vivawallet",
  "description": "Off-site Drupal Commerce payment gateway for Viva Wallet / Viva.com (Greek/EU PSP). Redirects to Viva Smart Checkout, then confirms payment by re-fetching the transaction from Viva's authenticated OAuth2 API (never trusting the return query or webhook body). Provides the 'vivawallet' gateway plugin, a matching payment method type, success/cancel/webhook routes, and a layered Guzzle service stack (OAuth2 token, create-order, get-transaction, webhook-verification).",
